[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Caro-Kann Defence"]
[Variation "Exchange Variation, Bf4 and Qb3"]
[ECO "B13"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,pawn-grab"]
[Kind "against-us"]

1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. c3 Nf6?! { Fine in itself, but without ...Qc7 White gets Bf4 and Qb3 in, attacking b7 and d5 at once. }
6. Bf4 Bg4 7. Qb3 { Hits both d5 and b7. Black must keep both guarded. }
7... e6? { Guards d5 but forgets b7, which the queen now takes for free. } ( 7... Qd7 { The right way: the queen guards both b7 and d5 at once. } 8. Nd2 e6 9. Ngf3 Bd6 )
8. Qxb7 { A free pawn, and the queen on b7 also hits the knight on c6 and the a8 rook. }
*
